*.log
*_utf8.log
build.log
build_utf8.log
error.log
error_utf8.log
start.log
start_utf8.log

# Python virtual environment
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# ML temp files
Backend/src/ml/error.log
Backend/src/ml/start.log
